{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_08_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_08",
  "title": "嘉维尔之拳",
  "storyCode": "RI-8",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6165e12bba5413d7d0933e1781694d567be37b01bd6649aed6f759d5a61acddf",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！哎，不对，下次我应该换个叫声，有点腻了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "喂，他没事吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "不用担心，等一会儿他就会回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "好吧，不过那真的是普通人吗？我没听说有这样的啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "不知道，大祭司只说过他在这里生活了很久很久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "好吧，比起这个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "呼，真是个了不得的大家伙啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "嘉维尔，你头上在流血啊，没事吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "没事没事，这点小伤，特米米，把我的医疗包拿过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "嗯？特米米这丫头人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerToken": "char_337_utage_summer_1",
      "operatorId": "char_337_utage",
      "portraitKey": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "给，你的医疗包。至于特米米，刚才快要赢的时候我好像看到她慌慌张张地往其他地方跑去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "谢了。她不会被吓破胆了吧，算了，先包扎再说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "对了，你们去看看有没有受伤的家伙，全部带到我这来，我来给他们治疗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerToken": "char_2013_cerber_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "portraitKey": "char_2013_cerber",
      "text": "噢，交给我吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "哈哈，没问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerToken": "char_337_utage_summer_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_337_utage",
      "portraitKey": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "诶，好麻烦啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "别抱怨啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "博士......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "大丑......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "祖玛玛，抱歉啊，只能把它拆掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我检查了一下，你的引擎还能用，我会把它还给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "是吗，太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "嘉维尔，你不打算留下来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "嗯，我和你一样，找到了要做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "是医生吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "做医生很开心吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "造机器很开心吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "开心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "那就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "但是，大酋长依然需要你来做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "哈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "无论如何，大丑倒下了是事实，你赢了，嘉维尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "看，人群重新聚集了起来，大家都在看着你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "啧，博士，怎么办啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "由你决定。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "这不是跟没说一样吗！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "博士，别装睡了！我可是医生！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "大酋长嘉维尔万岁！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "啧，博士，我现在真想给你一拳。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "嘉维尔，你没事吧！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嗯？没事。你跑哪里去了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "诶？啊，那个，我刚才忽然想上厕所！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "好吧......嗯？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "怎么了，嘉维尔，你怎么忽然看着我？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "唔......哈哈，有了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "所有人都听着！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "我战胜了大丑，所以接下来由我来担任大酋长。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "在这里，我要对你们说的是——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "拳头，就是一切！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "诶，嘉维尔，你要留下来做大酋长了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "但是！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "我有非常重要的事要去做，所以我还是要离开。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "不过你们不用担心！我不在的时候，会由特米米来代替我发号施令！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "把特米米当成是我就行了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "诶、诶诶诶？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "speakerToken": "char_337_utage_summer_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_337_utage",
          "portraitKey": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "诶，这样真的行得通吗？这里的人不是力量至上什么的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "但嘉维尔是大酋长，她已经征服了所有人，所以她说的话当然是令人信服的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "哈哈，祖玛玛，机器虽然很有意思，但是对我来说，果然还是拳头更好啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "哼，别忘了，我并没有承认你，我会造出更厉害的机器，然后再来挑战你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "好啊，我等着。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "哦对了，在那之前，你得跟我走一趟。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "为什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "你必须先跟我去罗德岛观察一下你的矿石病。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我可以拒绝吗，我还有大丑要......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "这次可由不得你，而且在特米米就任前，我就是大酋长，就算是绑着你我也要带你去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "好吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "......嘉维尔，你还是要走吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "是啊，等把引擎拆下来装回飞行器上，我就该走了吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
